# Vercel hosts the static frontend ONLY. The realtime bridge (MQTT/Redis) and the
# AI (Ollama) run in the Docker stack — not on Vercel — so excluding these keeps
# the deploy a clean frontend-only Vite build and avoids the serverless-function
# limit. For the full app, run the Docker stack (./start.sh), not Vercel.
api/
backend/
infra/
